  <name>Selviana Desktop Environment</name>
  <summary>The desktop of DebION GNU/Linux</summary>
  <developer id="org.debion">
    <name>DebION Dev-Team</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>The Selviana Desktop Environment (SDE) is a small and fast desktop with a modern look for
    DebION GNU/Linux. It includes the panel with the Start menu, the desktop with icons and
    wallpapers, the session manager, notifications, the run dialog and its own settings.</p>
    <p>SDE programs are built with SDE-FLTK, the DebION Dev-Team fork of FLTK 1.3 by Bill
    Spitzak and others.</p>
    <p>Developed by the DebION Dev-Team.</p>
  </description>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop/issues</url>
  <project_group>SDE</project_group>
  <provides>
    <binary>sde-session</binary>
    <binary>sde-panel</binary>
    <binary>sde-desktop</binary>
    <binary>sde-notifyd</binary>
    <binary>startsde</binary>
    <binary>sde-lock</binary>
  </provides>
